  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: kafka-clients 3.9.1.rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.apache.kafka:kafka-clients 3.9.1.rhlw-00001 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-33558 and CVE-2026-35554.\n\nCVE-2026-33558: Apache Kafka, Apache Kafka Clients: Information Exposure Through Network Client Log Output\n\nCVE-2026-35554: Apache Kafka Clients: Kafka Producer Message Corruption and Misrouting via Buffer Pool Race Condition\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.apache.kafka:kafka-clients 3.9.1 from Maven Central.",
